@prefix bl: <https://dagalog.no/ns/backlog#> .
@prefix ghissues: <https://github.com/daghovland/rdf-datalog/issues/> .
@prefix ghpull: <https://github.com/daghovland/rdf-datalog/pull/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix session: <https://dagalog.no/ns/agentprov/session#> .

# Retrospective transcript summary, backfilled for issue #355 (full backfill
# follow-up to the #352 sample), distilling PR #280's own body/commit history --
# no live session context was available (this PR predates or was outside this
# backfill session), per docs/plans/TRANSCRIPT_SUMMARY_GUIDELINES.md's
# retrospective case. Timestamps are real, from `gh pr view 280 --json
# commits,mergedAt`: startedAtTime is the first commit's authoredDate, endedAtTime is the PR's actual mergedAt.

ghpull:280 a bl:PullRequest, bl:WorkItem ;
    rdfs:label "fix(shacl): honor sh:deactivated on node and property shapes" ;
    bl:number 280 ;
    bl:state bl:Closed ;
    bl:closesIssue ghissues:262 .

session:claudeSonnet5 a prov:SoftwareAgent ;
    rdfs:label "Claude Sonnet 5" .

session:pr280 a agp:AgentSession ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith session:claudeSonnet5 ;
    prov:used ghissues:262 ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-07-24T15:13:17Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-07-24T17:28:12Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

session:pr280Summary a agp:TranscriptSummary ;
    agp:summaryText "sh:deactivated true must make a shape produce no validation results at all (SHACL §3), but no code checked this flag — every constraint on a \"deactivated\" shape was still evaluated and could still produce violations. Added a deactivated: bool field to both ParsedShape and ParsedPropShape (shacl/src/shapes.rs), parsed from sh:deactivated. Added a standalone is_deactivated(shapes, shape_id) helper for checking shape-graph references that aren't going through a full parse_one_shape call (e.g. sh:and inner shapes). Skip a deactivated shape's constraint generation/evaluation everywhere a shape is processed: Top-level shape/target loop in translate.rs::shapes_to_rules (Datalog rule generation) and evaluate.rs::eval_all (direct evaluation) sh:closed handling in lib.rs::pre_compute_violations sh:and inner shapes and their nested sh:property blocks The shared shape_conforms_for_node (added by #258) used by sh:or/sh:not/sh:node/sh:xone/sh:qualifiedValueShape — a deactivated inner shape is treated as vacuously satisfied" ;
    agp:reasoningFor ghpull:280 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy session:pr280 ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo session:claudeSonnet5 .
